  "lines": [
    {
      "id": "l1",
      "character": "narrator",
      "text": "Family dinner. At the table, the father and his sons. Suddenly the father says to the eldest:",
      "emotion": "neutral",
      "pauseAfterSec": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "l2",
      "character": "muzhik",
      "text": "Eat your soup properly! Why are you just picking at it, it's disgusting to watch!",
      "emotion": "angry",
      "pauseAfterSec": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "l3",
      "character": "paren",
      "text": "What are you yelling for?",
      "emotion": "angry",
      "pauseAfterSec": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "l4",
      "character": "muzhik",
      "text": "I'm yelling? Why, you little punk!",
      "emotion": "angry",
      "pauseAfterSec": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "l5",
      "character": "narrator",
      "text": "And whack, a smack on the back of the head! The second son chimes in:",
      "emotion": "surprised",
      "pauseAfterSec": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "l6",
      "character": "vovochka-drug",
      "text": "Dad, if a person doesn't want to eat, why are you forcing him, and hitting him on top of that? You're just like a tyrant.",
      "emotion": "sad",
      "pauseAfterSec": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "l7",
      "character": "muzhik",
      "text": "I'm a tyrant? Why, you swine!",
      "emotion": "angry",
      "pauseAfterSec": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "l8",
      "character": "narrator",
      "text": "And whack-whack, he boxes his ears.",
      "emotion": "surprised",
      "pauseAfterSec": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "l9",
      "character": "narrator",
      "text": "Then the youngest puts down his spoon and covers his ears with his hands. The father:",
      "emotion": "neutral",
      "pauseAfterSec": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "l10",
      "character": "muzhik",
      "text": "And why are you covering up? You eat well, you're polite, you don't talk back to your father, what are you afraid of?",
      "emotion": "surprised",
      "pauseAfterSec": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "l11",
      "character": "vovochka",
      "text": "I know I'm polite. It's just in case, you're such a jerk...",
      "uncensored": "I know I'm polite. It's just in case, you're such an asshole...",
      "emotion": "smug",
      "pauseAfterSec": 0.8,
      "laugh": "big"
    }
  ],
